{
  "_comment": [
    "EB-NeRD fixture, committed as JSON rather than Parquet on purpose.",
    "`*.parquet` is in config.FORBIDDEN_PATH_PATTERNS (Q8), and a binary fixture",
    "is unreviewable in a diff besides. tests/fixtures/build_fixtures.py turns",
    "this into the Parquet layout ebnerd.py actually reads, with the REAL dtypes.",
    "",
    "Timestamps deliberately straddle the real configured boundaries",
    "(val_start 2023-05-24 07:00 UTC, test_start 2023-05-25 07:00 UTC), so the",
    "fixture exercises the same split the real data does. An earlier version sat",
    "entirely in early May and could not be split at all -- a fixture that cannot",
    "reach the code path it is meant to test.",
    "",
    "Shaped for the awkward cases, not the happy path:",
    "  - list columns (article_ids_inview, article_id_fixed)",
    "  - the four post-click fields and three future-leaking aggregates (Q9.2)",
    "  - TIMESTAMPED history, unlike MIND, so the strict click_time <",
    "    impression_time check has something to bite on (Q9.4)",
    "  - history in both files, overlapping, so the union+dedupe path is real",
    "  - a cold-start user with no history at all",
    "  - an article with a null body"
  ],
